  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"p1\">• <span class=\"s1\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></span><br>ACEMATE is the world’s first AI tennis robot designed for real rally play. Unlike traditional ball machines, it can move, catch, and return shots dynamically, creating a more realistic training experience for players of all levels. ACEMATE is built for solo practice, structured drills, rally training, and serve practice—controlled through an all-in-one mobile app.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• <span class=\"s1\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></span><br>ACEMATE stands out with its human-like rally experience powered by 4K binocular vision and omnidirectional movement. It doesn’t just feed balls—it reacts to your shots, collects balls automatically, and enables interactive drills with target-zone training and performance scoring. It’s the closest thing to a real hitting partner.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• <span class=\"s1\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></span><br>Affiliates earn 10% commission on every successful purchase made through their referral link or discount code. Higher-performing partners may unlock special commission tiers, exclusive discount codes for their audience, and limited-time bonus incentives during campaigns.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• <span class=\"s1\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></span><br>You can promote ACEMATE through YouTube reviews, TikTok/Instagram training clips, coaching recommendations, club partnerships, tennis forums, email newsletters, and product comparison content. Short-form videos showing Rally Mode, Drill Mode, and real on-court use cases perform especially well.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• <span class=\"s1\"><strong>Other information:</strong></span><br>We provide affiliates with marketing assets, product highlights, and campaign updates. We may also offer free gifts, special bundles, and exclusive promotions for top partners. All affiliate orders are tracked through the UpPromote system for transparent reporting and payouts.</p></div>",
